Z||000004||pherder||08-27-2000||05:26 PM||||Too bad the second part of the job was delayed ... I was supposed to take the equipment to our Atlanta site to upgrade their equipment.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  Now it will be shipped back to Wichita, first, re-setup, and then shipped to Atlanta.  I will be going to Atlanta after my maintenance trip to Tampa and Fort Lauderdale, FL the second week in September.<P>Oh well, maybe I will take you up on a cold one (Mt. Dew?) next year at the third (and maybe last?) Fiero Swap Meet @ The Fiero Factory?<P>Later.<P>Paul||||reg||9
